{"unit_id":"caotaiyi__remvu#card-zh","repo":"caotaiyi/remvu","commit":"7ae4203aefbf458dd4346879d7d864e8e61e860a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Remvu 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的本地项目记忆插件，通过 DSH 原生工具和 agent/pre-step 上下文钩子接入独立 Remvu 引擎。它提供保存交接、恢复项目背景、检查记忆与代码新鲜度、浏览近期事件以及按 ID 查看证据等功能；可选记录直接用户消息和工具结果，并在会话开始或压缩后恢复一次上下文。适合在不同编码 agent 或 DSH 会话之间延续项目工作。使用前需要安装 Remvu 独立程序并初始化项目；自动记录默认关闭，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/index.js:126-163","adapters/dsh/index.js:141-157","adapters/dsh/cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
{"unit_id":"caotaiyi__remvu#card-en","repo":"caotaiyi/remvu","commit":"7ae4203aefbf458dd4346879d7d864e8e61e860a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Remvu adds local project memory to DeepSeek Harness. Native tools save handoffs, resume context, check freshness, browse events, and inspect evidence. Optional recording stores user messages and tool results locally. Initialize the project with the standalone app; recording is off by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/index.js:126-163","adapters/dsh/index.js:141-157","adapters/dsh/cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
