{"unit_id":"caotaiyi__remvu#feature-1","repo":"caotaiyi/remvu","commit":"7ae4203aefbf458dd4346879d7d864e8e61e860a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Remvu 的功能「保存项目交接」：通过 remvu_save 工具保存私有项目交接。可提交经过审阅的提案，也可导出已有状态；工具描述要求先查看相关记忆证据。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/index.js:141-157"]}
{"unit_id":"caotaiyi__remvu#feature-2","repo":"caotaiyi/remvu","commit":"7ae4203aefbf458dd4346879d7d864e8e61e860a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Remvu 的功能「恢复上下文」：会话开始或压缩后，agent/pre-step 钩子调用本地引擎恢复项目记忆，并将结果作为上下文消息加入当前会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/index.js:126-139"]}
{"unit_id":"caotaiyi__remvu#feature-3","repo":"caotaiyi/remvu","commit":"7ae4203aefbf458dd4346879d7d864e8e61e860a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Remvu 的功能「查看记忆证据」：可调用 remvu_events 浏览事件，并用 remvu_show 按 ID 查看证据；remvu_check 用于检查记忆状态与代码新鲜度。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/index.js:141-157"]}
